First release.
- Lets Claude read your AnkiDroid decks through your AnkiMCP account. One read-only tool for now: deck names and today's due counts.
- On demand mode: Claude wakes the phone when it needs it, and the app disconnects when the screen turns off or after 15-60 idle minutes.
- Always connected mode keeps the tunnel open (uses more battery).
- Battery tips for Realme, Oppo, OnePlus, Xiaomi, Vivo and Huawei phones.
- Share log button for bug reports.
